step Duskwood
  zone Duskwood
  goto 75.8,45.3 "Duskwood"

# Duskwood, Alliance ~22.7 to ~25.4.
#
# Route from the simulator's consensus Alliance route (Human export, visit 5:
# Duskwood 22.7-25.4), written out as a playable guide; not play-tested on
# Forever yet.
#
# Flow: Darkshire (every quest giver, the Bronze Tube from Herble) -> the
# Tranquil Gardens Cemetery -> Darkshire -> west along the road: Watcher
# Dodds, Raven Hill (Memory of Valor, Skeletal Horrors and Fiends), Sven's
# camp, the Raven Hill Cemetery and Abercrombie (wolves, spiders, ghouls) ->
# back east: Watcher Dodds, the Yorgen Farmstead -> hearth to Darkshire, Blind
# Mary -> west: Abercrombie, Sven -> Darkshire -> the
# Skeletal Horrors south-east of town (Rot Blossoms) -> Darkshire -> west: Abercrombie, the
# ghouls, Jitters, Sven -> north through Elwynn for training (Shamans in
# Ironforge by the Deeprun Tram, Rogues in Stormwind) -> east along the road
# to Redridge's second pass at about 25-26 (Rogues fly there from Stormwind):
# Lakeshire, Gar'im's cave, Stonewatch Keep, Fangore's camp, Lakeshire -> fly
# to Stormwind and on to Menethil Harbor, where the next guide (06-wetlands)
# starts.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Look To The Stars (174): the export finds the Bronze Tube on Venture Co.
#   machines in Stonetalon (a 1-2% drop). Herble Baubbletump sells it in
#   Darkshire, next to Viktori; the turn-in stays where the export has it, in
#   the Duskwood return (07-thousand-needles).
# - Wolves at Our Heels (226) is turned in on the second visit to Sven's camp
#   (Lars stands beside Sven) instead of walking back west for it.
# - Hearthstone: the export hearths twice on the first loop (23.7 and 24.4);
#   here once from the Yorgen Farmstead and once after the second western loop,
#   so the cooldown allows both.
# - The Darkshire flight path and hearth bind belong to the export's Redridge
#   visit (it arrives here bound); repeated in the first step in case you come
#   in without them.
# - Dropped Awaiting Word (236): a no-XP breadcrumb to Watcher Callahan at
#   Manor Mistmantle, a detour north the route never passes otherwise.
# - Redridge's second pass (the elites Tharil'zun 19, Gath'Ilzogg 169,
#   Incinerator Gar'im 95999, Shadow Magic's Blackrock Shadowcasters 115, and
#   Lieutenant Fangore 180, 26) comes at the end, at about 25-26, where those
#   quests fit: players finished them solo at 21-23 in the recordings, so they
#   are in the route's steps with a tip to group up if you can; the four elite
#   quests' goals are optional (the leveling rule for elite-only drops),
#   Fangore's (not elite) is not. One loop: Lakeshire,
#   south-east to Gar'im, north through Stonewatch Keep, north-east to
#   Fangore, west to Lakeshire and its flight to Stormwind.
# - Worgen in the Woods (173) needs level 23: the step before it says so.
#
# Class quests: Rogues finish Mathias and the Defias with Klaven's Tower
# (2360, 2359, Poisons) at the end: Agent Kearnen and the tower stand just
# over the Westfall border from Raven Hill, and Mathias Shaw is in Stormwind
# on the way to the boat. Optional for Rogues there: The Touch of Zanzil
# (2607-2609, Doc Mixilpixil in the Barracks cellar; Wildflowers, a Leaded
# Vial and a Bronze Tube from Stormwind vendors, the thread in the city),
# 1,305 XP without leaving Stormwind.
# Human Paladins hand the Defias Script (1787, from Henze Faulk in
# 04-redridge-mountains) to Gazin Tenorm at the Stormwind stop and learn
# Redemption from Duthorian Rall (1788).
#
# Left out (not in the export): Jitters' Growling Gut and Dusky Crab Cakes
# (163, 5, 93), Seasoned Wolf Kabobs (90: Cooking), The Weathered Grave chain
# (225: ends at the elite Mor'Ladim), Ira's Dagger (96137: it starts from a
# drop of the Lost Stalkers, Forever's new Duskwood mobs, at an unknown rate,
# and is not in the new consensus either).
# Refresh (2026): Merrick's Bow (96138) now has a known start, a drop of the
# Lost Watchers; the new consensus does it at 28 with the ogres of Vul'Gol,
# so it is an optional extra in 07-thousand-needles' Duskwood return. The
# Valor Family (98447, a Forever quest listed for Duskwood, level 27)
# is not in our data: no giver, objective or ender we can place, so it is
# not added. The Valor Family 96139 (Sirra Von'Indi) stays as it is.
# Checked and skipped: The Legend of Stalvan (98) needs 97 (the Stalvan
# chain through Westfall and Elwynn, not on this route) and ends at Stalvan
# Mistmantle, an elite.

