step Fly to Lakeshire
  only Rogue
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 66.3,62.7 "Stormwind flight master"
  fly "Lakeshire"

step Redridge Mountains
  only !Rogue
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Follow the road east from Goldshire through Elwynn to Three Corners, then along the lake to Lakeshire.
  goto 15.3,71.5 "Redridge Mountains"

step Lakeshire
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Marshal Marris stands at the north end of the bridge; two Wanted posters hang on the town hall doorway, a third by the inn.
  accept 19 optional                      -- Marshal Marris
  accept 115 optional
  accept 169 optional                     -- The Wanted poster on the town hall doorway
  accept 95999 optional                   -- The Wanted poster beside it
  accept 180                              -- The Wanted poster by the inn

step Incinerator Gar'im
  tip East past the mill, then south-east to the Blackrock camps east of Stonewatch Keep: Gar'im keeps to the cave at their south end with his imp and two orcs. Elite: group up if you can; solo, pull the orcs at the mouth first and interrupt his fire cast. He drops a Midnight Orb too.
  collect 271872 quest 95999 optional     -- Broken Staff of Incinerator Gar'im

step Stonewatch Keep
  tip North to Stonewatch Keep. Blackrock Shadowcasters (elite) stand with Sentries on its west side: pull one at a time. Then Tharil'zun (elite) in the south-west courtyard with his guards, and Gath'Ilzogg (elite) in the keep's top room with two guards and a dragon: hug the right wall as you enter so you don't pull him at once. Elite: group up if you can.
  collect 1261 quest 115 optional         -- Midnight Orb: Blackrock Shadowcasters
  collect 1260 quest 19 optional          -- Tharil'zun's Head
  collect 3633 quest 169 optional         -- Head of Gath'Ilzogg

step Lieutenant Fangore
  tip North-east to the gnolls' eastern camp in Galardell Valley. Fangore has two guards linked to him: clear the gnolls around him first and fight at full health.
  collect 3632 quest 180                  -- Fangore's Paw

step Back to Lakeshire
  tip West back to Lakeshire.
  turnin 19 optional                      -- Marshal Marris
  turnin 115 optional
  turnin 180                              -- Magistrate Solomon, in the town hall
  turnin 169 optional
  turnin 95999 optional

step Fly to Stormwind
  zone Redridge Mountains
  goto 25.5,59.4 "Lakeshire flight master"
  fly "Stormwind"